# Text is kept with plain line feeds everywhere, so the skill packs to the same contents on every machine.
# (Same files, same dates, same checksums. The compressed bytes of dist/voss.zip can still differ from one
# system to the next, because zlib builds differ: after a build elsewhere git may show it as modified.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
